+# Phase 5 checkpoint: Listings 2B — deletion cleanup defect
+
+Date: 2026-10-30 (Asia/Colombo). Baseline: version-3.0, 8625cbbbc2c109956cbe7485e6e88ca0bc130da3, with preceding uncommitted Phase5 test batches retained.
+
+## Status
+
+2B remains in progress pending a separate production-fix decision. Real Storage testing reproduced a defect: SELLER and ADMIN listing deletion each returns HTTP200 and removes the property row, but retains its image object and physical file; public image GET remains200. Desired cleanup assertions remain failing. Test fixture cleanup succeeding does not make product deletion correct.
+
+No production code, dependencies, application .env, schema migrations, workers, live data or payments were changed. No commit/push/staging. The proposed fix is a separate reviewable design, not an applied patch: `superpowers/specs/2026-10-30-listing-image-cleanup-fix-design.md`.
+
+## Evidence
+
+Run from backend-node: `node integration/run-storage.cjs`. Three diagnostic runs reproduced the same two deletion failures; the final run includes strengthened rollback proof and physical/public-file evidence.
+
+| Check | Result |
+| --- | --- |
+| Storage readiness/preflight | Exact local identity and read-only bucket/schema/metadata/file state pass |
+| Initial real Storage run | 10 pass,2 deletion failures;18.448s Jest total |
+| Repeat with physical/public-byte observations | 10 pass,2 same failures;18.704s |
+| Final run with strengthened rollback proof | 10 pass,2 same failures;20.102s |
+| Seller/admin deletion observation, each | DB row absent;target object1,physical file1,public GET200 |
+| Each run's independent fixture cleanup | Actual Storage API removed exact owned objects/files; app and Storage full-state preservation pass |
+| Pure new Storage guard/state/transport tests | 63 pass (44 identity,6 state,13 transport), also included in full backend run |
