+## Root cause and owner decision
+
+Both delete repositories delete only from public.properties; neither removes images/virtual_tours objects. The failure is independent of upload rollback, which passed with actual transfer proof. A bounded proposal shares validated managed-path cleanup across seller/admin deletion, after a successful DB DELETE, with awaited Storage removal and explicit failure reporting/recovery paths. It preserves images when a DB deletion fails. It does not provide crash-safe cross-resource atomicity; a durable cleanup outbox is a larger alternative requiring separate design/approval.
